    "preamble": "Chadalavada Nageswara Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 26 July, 2019 The Honourable Sri Justice D.V.S.S.Somayajulu Criminal Petition No.4430 of 2019 Order:",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "2. Heard the learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor. 3. Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that in a similar case, this Court, by virtue of a common order in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch, [LEAKAGE_MASK] the proceedings against the petitioners therein by considering that transportation of Gutka is not attracted by the offences alleged under Sections 188, 270 and 273 I.P.C. and FSS Act.",
